      ],
      "text": "4.1.1. Justification and evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        446.82891845703125,
        527.4342041015625,
        461.2719421386719
      ],
      "text": "The development of the Xpert MTB/RIF assay (Cepheid, Sunnyvale, United States of America (United",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        460.0289001464844,
        527.5482177734375,
        474.471923828125
      ],
      "text": "States)) was a significant step forward in improving the diagnosis of TB and the detection of rifampicin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977226257324219,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        473.2289123535156,
        527.1593017578125,
        487.67193603515625
      ],
      "text": "resistance globally. However, Xpert MTB/RIF sensitivity is suboptimal, particularly among people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        486.42889404296875,
        527.60107421875,
        500.8719177246094
      ],
      "text": "(including children) with smear-negative TB and people (including children) living with HIV. The Xpert",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998749732971191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        499.62890625,
        527.2046508789062,
        514.0718994140625
      ],
      "text": "MTB/RIF Ultra (Cepheid, Sunnyvale, United States), hereafter referred to as Xpert Ultra, was developed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968103408813477,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        512.8289184570312,
        527.4111938476562,
        527.2719116210938
      ],
      "text": "by Cepheid as the next-generation assay to overcome these limitations. Xpert Ultra has a lower limit",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        526.0289306640625,
        527.4375,
        540.471923828125
      ],
      "text": "of detection than the Xpert MTB/RIF, with an additional “trace” semi-quantitative category. It uses",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.2288818359375,
        527.3997192382812,
        553.671875
      ],
      "text": "the same GeneXpert  platform as the Xpert MTB/RIF. Xpert MTB/RIF is strongly recommended as  ®",
