        70.86609649658203,
        552.4288940429688,
        527.4593505859375,
        566.8718872070312
      ],
      "text": "the initial diagnostic test for TB and rifampicin-resistance detection in sputum (including induced and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993047714233398,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        565.62890625,
        527.3969116210938,
        580.0718994140625
      ],
      "text": "spontaneously expectorated sputum), gastric aspirate, NPA and stool specimens rather than smear",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        578.8289184570312,
        527.3817749023438,
        593.2719116210938
      ],
      "text": "microscopy/culture and phenotypic DST in children aged below 15 years with signs and symptoms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.0289306640625,
        527.436767578125,
        606.471923828125
      ],
      "text": "of PTB. The Xpert Ultra assay is recommended in the same population as the initial diagnostic test",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
